   {
    "en": "Child Prodigy and The Beast"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Shindou to Moujuu"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Sano Ken'ichi is known to others as a prodigy and he doesn't mix well with his surroundings. Suzuki Erina, on the other hand, is called a beast and is often made fun of by those around her. After their first interaction, these two friendless loners quickly became close friends.\n\nHowever, both their families have their own complicated circumstances which their parents are worrying over in their own way. What sort of change will their meeting bring to their family!?\n\nThis story also showcases the changes and growth undergone by the family members of the two protagonists.\n\nTwitter Compilation\n\n*Note: The story was first published as part of a doujinshi collection in 2018. It was restarted as a series in 2021 on Twitter. Characters and children of characters from Katou Mayumi's three \"Aru\" series also appear in this story. *",
   "ja": "第1巻の内容紹介: 神童と呼ばれ、周りから浮いている佐野健一は、猛獣と呼ばれ、周りからからかわれている鈴木エリナと出会う。\n他に友達がおらず孤独だった二人は急速に仲良くなっていく。\nしかしそれぞれの家庭には複雑な事情があり、二人の親もそれぞれ悩んでいた。\nこの二人の出会いにより両家族はどう変化していくのか…！？\n\nツイッターにて毎日更新している作品をまとめました。今後毎月、新刊が発売されます。\nこの物語は、主人公二人だけでなく、彼らの家族の変化と成長も描いていきます。群像劇としてお楽しみください。"
  },
